 HTTP; playing uses no generation API.",[642],{"_71":643,"_34":626,"_114":644},"Play Raccoon Heist","Press Start the Heist. Use WASD or arrows to move and Space to dash; mobile has a touch stick and Dash button. Collect loot automatically and return to the dumpster to bank it.",[646],{"_71":647,"_34":648,"_114":-7},"Read the creator’s full build walkthrough","https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/5/raccoon-heist/",[650,651,652,653],"Play a night and test movement, loot pickup, carrying limits, banking, and getting caught.","Read the creator’s walkthrough of the prompt, art generation, and GitHub Pages workflow.","Use the build notes to study the playable core, mobile rendering fixes, and guard-dog behavior.","Serve the full game locally and compare its code and assets with the documented decisions.","创作者公开提示词、Claude Code 会话、生成纹理与开发记录。Claude 实现并测试游戏，作者另行评价其优点和玩法限制。","资产制作工具",false,[659],"assetTools","gpt-image-2","Three.js · JavaScript",[659],[650,651,652,653],{"_71":647,"_34":648,"_26":176},{"_71":643,"_34":626,"_26":124,"_114":644},{"_71":334,"_34":639,"_174":175,"_114":640},{"_71":634,"_34":635,"_114":636},[332,333,173],"example:claude-agent-team-tetris","claude-agent-team-tetris","Tetris：代理团队协作开发","完整的浏览器俄罗斯方块，作者公开说明三个 Claude Code 队友如何分别负责规则、渲染与控制。","/zh/examples/claude-agent-team-tetris/",{"_28":669,"_30":670,"_32":671,"_162":727,"_158":164,"_154":165,"_150":726,"_9":728,"_135":729,"_125":730,"_41":731,"_110":732,"_100":733},[676,677,678,679,680,681,682,683,684,685,686,687,688,689,690,691,692,693,694],"Tetris built by an AI agent team",{"_67":30,"_73":670,"_69":30,"_101":-7,"_75":44},{"_67":163,"_73":671,"_69":32,"_101":-7,"_75":44},{"_67":68,"_71":160,"_73":727,"_69":162,"_101":151,"_75":76},{"_67":68,"_71":156,"_73":157,"_69":158,"_101":159,"_75":76},{"_67":68,"_71":152,"_73":153,"_69":154,"_101":155,"_75":44},{"_67":68,"_71":148,"_73":726,"_69":150,"_101":151,"_75":44},{"_67":91,"_71":141,"_142":143,"_94":721,"_69":9,"_101":-7,"_75":76},{"_67":97,"_71":136,"_94"